Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: %empty
    2        | program function

    3 function: FUNC TOKEN_IDENTIFIER LEFTPAREN new_parameters RIGHTPAREN LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY
    4         | FUNC type TOKEN_IDENTIFIER LEFTPAREN new_parameters RIGHTPAREN LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY

    5 function_call: TOKEN_IDENTIFIER LEFTPAREN parameters RIGHTPAREN

    6 new_parameters: %empty
    7               | new_parameter
    8               | new_parameters COMMA new_parameter

    9 new_parameter: type TOKEN_IDENTIFIER

   10 parameters: %empty
   11           | expressions
   12           | expressions COMMA expressions

   13 statements: %empty
   14           | statements statement

   15 statement: new_variable
   16          | new_array
   17          | function_call
   18          | print
   19          | RETURN expressions SEMICOLON
   20          | BREAK SEMICOLON
   21          | CONTINUE SEMICOLON
   22          | if_statement
   23          | while_statement
   24          | read_statement
   25          | write_statement
   26          | assignment

   27 new_variable: type TOKEN_IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON
   28             | type TOKEN_IDENTIFIER ASSIGN NUMBER SEMICOLON

   29 variable: NUMBER
   30         | TOKEN_IDENTIFIER
   31         | array_get_pointer
   32         | function_call

   33 new_array: type LEFTBRACKET NUMBER RIGHTBRACKET TOKEN_IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON

   34 array_get_pointer: TOKEN_IDENTIFIER LEFTBRACKET NUMBER RIGHTBRACKET

   35 type: INT

   36 print: PRINT LEFTPAREN variable RIGHTPAREN SEMICOLON

   37 assignment: TOKEN_IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expressions SEMICOLON
   38           | array_get_pointer ASSIGN expressions SEMICOLON

   39 expressions: %empty
   40            | expressions expression

   41 expression: variable
   42           | LEFTPAREN expression RIGHTPAREN
   43           | expression PLUS expression
   44           | expression SUBTRACT expression
   45           | expression MULTIPLY expression
   46           | expression DIVIDE expression
   47           | expression MODULUS expression

   48 boolean_expressions: expression GREATER expression
   49                    | expression LESS expression
   50                    | expression LESSEQUAL expression
   51                    | expression GREATEREQUAL expression
   52                    | expression EQUALITY expression
   53                    | expression NOTEQUAL expression

   54 if_statement: IF LEFTPAREN boolean_expressions RIGHTPAREN LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY else_statement
   55             | IF boolean_expressions LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY else_statement

   56 else_statement: ELSE LEFTCURLY statement RIGHTCURLY
   57               | %empty

   58 while_statement: WHILE boolean_expressions LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY
   59                | WHILE LEFTPAREN boolean_expressions RIGHTPAREN LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY

   60 read_statement: READ LEFTPAREN TOKEN_IDENTIFIER RIGHTPAREN SEMICOLON

   61 write_statement: WRITE LEFTPAREN expressions RIGHTPAREN SEMICOLON


